text.en:
Section 3 of the Legal Profession Act, in this Order referred to as the Act, is

(a) in paragraph (b) of subsection (2), by deleting "person to whom a Residence Permit has been granted under regulations made under the Act" and by substituting "permanent resident," therefor;

(b) in subsection 13), by deleting "person to whom a Residence Permit has been granted under regulations made under the Immigration Act" from the third and fourth lines and by substituting "permanent resident" therefor. of section 13.
